    ./in.cue:37:6
    ./in.cue:37:43
lessString.ss: error in call to list.SortStable: cannot use "foo" (type string) as type bool:
    ./in.cue:38:6
    ./in.cue:38:49
lessString.is: error in call to list.IsSorted: cannot use "foo" (type string) as type bool:
    ./in.cue:39:6
    ./in.cue:39:47
lessString.v: invalid value [2,1] (does not satisfy list.IsSorted({x:_,y:_,less:"foo"})): cannot use "foo" (type string) as type bool:
    ./in.cue:40:15
    ./in.cue:40:6
    ./in.cue:40:48
lessMissing.s: error in call to list.Sort: field not found: less:
    ./in.cue:47:6
lessMissing.is: error in call to list.IsSorted: field not found: less:
    ./in.cue:48:6

